      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I believe this would also mimic the behavior seen on contacts where they also scale when the gameobject is scaled, up to the 3m radius maximum. Raycasts could do something similar w/ their 1000m maximum. If an asset creator needs the raycast to stay a fixed size while everything else scales, they could also stick it inside a static scale constraint.",
